  "description": "MAUI Performance Overlay lightweight, drag-and-move performance HUD for .NET MAUI apps.\n\t\t\tIt shows real-time FPS, Frame Time, CPU usage, Memory usage, Threads, GC Collections, Allocations/sec, and UI thread hitches.\n\t\t\tIdeal for diagnostics and profiling MAUI applications on Android, iOS, MacCatalyst, Tizen, and Windows.\n\t\t\tEasily integrates into your app to monitor performance and responsiveness.",
